// Copy this file to Config.xcconfig (already gitignored) and fill in your
// own Apple Developer Team ID. This is what makes signing survive
// `xcodegen generate` — XcodeGen regenerates the whole .xcodeproj from
// project.yml on every run, which would otherwise wipe out a team you'd
// only picked by hand in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities UI. This file isn't
// touched by regeneration, so setting it here is a one-time step.
//
// Find your Team ID at https://developer.apple.com/account/#/membership,
// or in Xcode: Settings -> Accounts -> (your Apple ID) -> (your team).
// A free personal team works fine for local device testing.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
